_SUBMISSION:"Attention, by clicking on cancel sending, the envelope consumption of the package contracted with Docusign will not be reversed.",CANCEL_SIGN_SUBMISSION:"Canceling this submission will make the signing link unavailable to recipients.",CANCEL_SUBSCRIPTION_SUBMISSION:"Cancel Subscription Submission",CONFIRMATION_CANCEL_SIGN_SUBMISSION:"cancel this submission, making the signing link unavailable to the recipients",D4SIGN_FOLDER:"D4Sign Folder",D4SIGN_VAULT:"D4Sign Vault",DATA_PLACE:{DATA_PLACE_DESCRIPTION:"A robust and modern management system that automates your company and helps you make the best decisions. Dataplace is an ERP with more than 30 years in the market and with hundreds of customers inside and outside Brazil.<br><br >With it you can integrate and control your purchasing and finance departments, the manufacture of your products (even at third parties), control batches, generate budgets and sales orders, manage billing and invoices, integrate means of payment , marketplaces and automates your sales force.<br><br>Through the integration between Dataplace ERP and Ploomes, your customers, contacts, products, budgets and sales orders are synchronized. Click the button below for more details about this project:<br><br><a class='button button-big neutral-badge' target='_blank' href='https://www.notion.so/ploomes/Dataplace-Ploomes-5f880ce271774038ab199afcd6aec7fa'>Integration Documentation</a>",DATA_PLACE_DOCUMENTATION:"Integration documentation",DATA_PLACE_REQUEST_CONTACT:"Request Contact"},DEACTIVATE_INTEGRATION:"Deactivate integration",DEACTIVATING_INTEGRATION:"Deactivating integration",DISABLE_INTEGRATION:"Disable integration",DISABLE_INTEGRATION_VARIATION:"Disable integration",DISABLING_INTEGRATION:"Disabling integration",DOCUMENT_CANCEL_SUCESS:"The document signing submission has been canceled.",DOCUMENT_CLICKSIGN_SENT:"Sending document for signature, you will be notified of the result shortly.",DOCUMENT_SENT:"Document sent for signature!",DOCUM